      <div class="faq">
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What is the minimum order for custom shorts?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            SDF Clothing manufactures custom shorts with a minimum order of 300 pieces per style. This low MOQ makes shorts manufacturing accessible to startup brands, boutique labels, and businesses launching new shorts lines. We offer flexible size and color breakdowns within the 300 piece minimum, allowing you to test designs and scale gradually. Our 300 piece MOQ is significantly lower than many manufacturers who require 500-1,000 pieces for athletic and casual shorts.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What fabrics are best for athletic shorts?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            Athletic shorts require performance fabrics that wick moisture, provide stretch, and withstand frequent washing. Polyester and polyester-spandex blends (typically 85-95% polyester, 5-15% spandex) are the most popular athletic short fabrics due to moisture-wicking properties, durability, and four-way stretch. Performance mesh fabrics offer enhanced breathability for high-intensity activities. Nylon blends provide superior strength and abrasion resistance for demanding sports. For eco-conscious brands, recycled polyester (rPET) made from post-consumer plastic bottles offers identical performance with environmental benefits.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">Can you manufacture denim shorts with custom washes?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            Yes, SDF manufactures denim shorts with custom washes and finishes. We offer a full range of denim washes including light wash, medium wash, dark wash, vintage wash, stone wash, acid wash, and enzyme wash. Distressing options include rips, tears, fraying, whiskering, and abrasion effects. Our denim shorts manufacturing includes both new denim construction and upcycled denim shorts made from repurposed jeans. We can achieve vintage, distressed, or clean aesthetics based on your brand positioning. Custom wash development requires sample approval before bulk production.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">Do you offer moisture-wicking fabrics for activewear shorts?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            Yes, all our athletic shorts use moisture-wicking fabrics designed to keep wearers dry during physical activity. We source performance polyester fabrics with moisture-wicking technology that pulls sweat away from the skin and allows it to evaporate quickly. These fabrics also offer quick-dry properties, making them ideal for sports, gym wear, and activewear. We can incorporate mesh paneling in strategic areas for enhanced breathability.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">How long does shorts manufacturing take?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            Shorts manufacturing typically takes 30-45 days from sample approval to shipment. The timeline includes: pattern making and grading (3-5 days), sample development with all construction details (7-10 days), sample approval and any revisions (3-5 days), cutting and sewing bulk production (15-25 days), final quality inspection and finishing (2-3 days), and packing for shipment (2-3 days). Complex styles with multiple prints, special washes, or intricate details may add 5-10 days.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">Can you make board shorts for swimwear?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            Yes, SDF manufactures board shorts for swimwear using quick-dry, water-resistant fabrics. We source polyester and nylon fabrics specifically designed for swimwear, including options with UPF sun protection ratings. Board shorts feature longer inseams (typically 9-11 inches), lace-up or drawstring waistbands, and side pockets with drain holes. We can add branded waistbands, sublimated prints, and custom logos. Our swimwear shorts meet chlorine resistance and color fastness standards.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What certifications do your short fabrics have?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">
            SDF Clothing's short fabrics hold multiple international certifications including OEKO-TEX Standard 100 for chemical safety, GRS (Global Recycled Standard) for recycled materials, GOTS for organic cotton options, and REACH compliance for EU markets. Our manufacturing facilities are BSCI certified for social compliance and WRAP certified for ethical manufacturing. These certifications ensure your shorts meet retailer requirements and consumer expectations for safety, sustainability, and responsibility.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
